  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a point in every deeply thinking human…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1722
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "where explanations stop working."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1723
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because truth arrives."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1724
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because the mind gets exhausted."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1725
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Exhausted of translating everything."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1726
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Exhausted of converting experience into meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1727
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Exhausted of trying to stay in control through understanding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1728
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this exhaustion is not loud."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1729
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not announce itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1730
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not feel like a breakthrough."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1731
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels like silence inside thought itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1732
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A strange mental fatigue where even questions start losing urgency."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1733
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Earlier, everything demanded explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1734
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A delay had meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1735
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A silence had interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1736
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A reaction had psychology."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1737
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A failure had lesson."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1738
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A success had validation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1739
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A person had intention."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1740
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A moment had hidden message."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1741
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing was allowed to simply exist."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1742
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Everything had to become something else."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1743
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But slowly…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1744
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "a subtle shift begins."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1745
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not in reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1746
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "In response to reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1747
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a gap."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1748
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Between what happens…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1749
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and what the mind does with it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1750
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A small delay in interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1751
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At first, the mind still tries."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1752
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Still reaches for meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1753
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Still tries to label."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1754
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Still tries to connect patterns."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1755
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But something feels off."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1756
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Like the system is running…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1757
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but slower than before."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1758
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in that slowness…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1759
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "something unusual happens."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1760
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A moment is not immediately consumed by thought."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1761
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It just stays."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1762
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Raw."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1763
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Unprocessed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1764
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Untranslated."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1765
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this feels almost unnatural."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1766
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because the mind was never trained for “non-interpretation”."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1767
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was trained for survival through meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1768
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning = safety."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1769
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning = control."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1770
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning = predictability."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1771
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So when meaning does not appear immediately…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1772
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "a discomfort arises."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1773
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not fear exactly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1774
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But unfamiliar emptiness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1775
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A gap without explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1776
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the mind tries to fix it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1777
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It reaches again."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1778
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "For story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1779
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "For reason."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1780
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "For pattern."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1781
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "For conclusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1782
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But sometimes…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1783
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "nothing fits."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1784
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And for the first time…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1785
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the mind is forced to remain with the moment…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1786
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "without owning it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1787
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A sound is heard."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1788
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And it does not become a memory."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1789
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It remains a sound."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1790
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A face is seen."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1791
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And it does not become a judgment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1792
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It remains a face."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1793
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A silence arrives."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1794
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And it does not become emotional analysis."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1795
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It remains silence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1796
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in this simple existence of things…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1797
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "something very deep starts shifting."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1798
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not outside."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1799
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Inside perception itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1800
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because what is happening is not “new understanding”."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1801
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is the slowing down of interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1802
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And when interpretation slows down…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1803
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "reality becomes sharper."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1804
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because it changed…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1805
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because it is no longer filtered immediately."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1806
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But this clarity is not comfortable at first."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1807
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because comfort was built on meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1808
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If everything had meaning…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1809
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "then everything felt manageable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1810
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even pain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1811
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even confusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1812
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even loss."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1813
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But now…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1814
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "meaning itself is not arriving instantly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1815
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that creates a strange exposure."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1816
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not of danger."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1817
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But of rawness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1818
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A moment where nothing is being added to experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1819
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1820
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1821
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No future projection."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1822
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No past reference."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1823
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just now."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1824
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Unclaimed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1825
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the mind struggles here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1826
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because it wants to complete experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1827
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It wants to “finish” reality into understanding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1828
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But reality refuses completion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1829
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It keeps unfolding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1830
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without permission."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1831
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without conclusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1832
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And slowly…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1833
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "a strange observation becomes possible:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1834
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not everything that happens is pointing somewhere."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1835
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not every silence is hiding something."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1836
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not every emotional wave is symbolic."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1837
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not every experience is a message."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1838
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Some things are just occurring."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1839
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without agenda."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1840
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without design for interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1841
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this realization does not feel powerful."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1842
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels neutral."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1843
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Almost empty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1844
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But this emptiness is not absence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1845
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is space."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1846
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in that space…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1847
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "something very subtle emerges."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1848
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Presence without commentary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1849
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not awareness as concept."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1850
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But awareness without translation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1851
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A moment is experienced…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1852
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "without becoming a thought about the moment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1853
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this is where the shift becomes irreversible for a glimpse."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1854
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because for the first time…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1855
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "there is a difference between:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1856
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "living experience"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1857
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and explaining experience"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1858
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And it becomes visible that most of life was not lived…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1859
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it was processed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1860
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this realization does not create excitement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1861
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It creates stillness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1862
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A very unfamiliar stillness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1863
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because nothing is being extracted from the moment anymore."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1864
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1865
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No lesson."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1866
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No insight being forced."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1867
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in that stillness…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1868
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "something breaks quietly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1869
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not identity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1870
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not memory."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1871
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But the need to constantly convert life into understanding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1872
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And when that pressure reduces…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1873
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "life becomes strangely immediate."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1874
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not extraordinary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1875
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not mystical."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1876
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just immediate."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1877
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in that immediacy…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1878
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "there is no distance between “you” and experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1879
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only participation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1880
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not observer versus observed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1881
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But simply unfolding."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1882
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And for a brief moment…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1883
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "there is no need to explain what is happening…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1884
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "because nothing is missing from what is happening."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1885
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that is the strange edge:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1886
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Life was never incomplete."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1887
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only the interpretation was."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1888
    }
  ],
